.TH ox-migrate 1  "ox-migrate " 
.SH NAME
ox\-migrate \- Review or apply a workflow schema migration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBox\-migrate\fR [\fB\-f\fR|\fB\-\-file\fR] <\fB\-\-to\-format\fR> [\fB\-\-write\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Review or apply a workflow schema migration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-file\fR \fI<FILE>\fR [default: Oxymakefile.toml]
Oxymakefile path (includes are resolved relative to each file)
.TP
\fB\-\-to\-format\fR \fI<TO_FORMAT>\fR
Destination schema version
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
2
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-write\fR
Apply the reviewed migration to every file in the include graph
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
